      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "org_unit_closure(ancestor_id, descendant_id, depth)   one row per ancestor pair\norg_units.path  ltree/text   '/acct/bu/dl'  for prefix filters and index scans\nRollup rows carry org_path so a manager view is a prefix match, not a join storm.\nReparenting rewrites closure + path for the moved subtree in one transaction.",
      "originalText": "org_unit_closure(ancestor_id, descendant_id, depth)   one row per ancestor pair\norg_units.path  ltree/text   '/acct/bu/dl'  for prefix filters and index scans\nRollup rows carry org_path so a manager view is a prefix match, not a join storm.\nReparenting rewrites closure + path for the moved subtree in one transaction.",
