      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "visible_members(viewer) =\n   {self}\n ∪ {members of org units where viewer holds a grant with scope=org_unit and subtree=true}\n ∪ {all members, when the viewer holds account-scoped activity:read_all}\nEvery activity, cost and risk query is filtered by this set. No endpoint accepts a\ncaller-supplied member filter without intersecting it with the caller's own scope.",
      "originalText": "visible_members(viewer) =\n   {self}\n ∪ {members of org units where viewer holds a grant with scope=org_unit and subtree=true}\n ∪ {all members, when the viewer holds account-scoped activity:read_all}\nEvery activity, cost and risk query is filtered by this set. No endpoint accepts a\ncaller-supplied member filter without intersecting it with the caller's own scope.",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.45,
      "autoResize": true
